    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.11"&gt;11.3.11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add support for parsing &lt;code&gt;BoxShadows&lt;/code&gt; with color functions by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/gehongyan/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/gehongyan"&gt;@gehongyan&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3750853197" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20321" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20321/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20321"&gt;#20321&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Set &lt;code&gt;XkbSetDetectableAutoRepeat&lt;/code&gt; to true by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/flabbet/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/flabbet"&gt;@flabbet&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3763349972" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20360" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20360/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20360"&gt;#20360&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix thread-race condition in &lt;code&gt;Dispatcher&lt;/code&gt; on shutdown by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/11v1/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/11v1"&gt;@11v1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3741187981" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20299" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20299/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20299"&gt;#20299&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;NullReferenceException&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;TextShaperImpl.ShapeText&lt;/code&gt; on netstandard2.0 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/adams85/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/adams85"&gt;@adams85&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3766049489" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20369" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20369/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20369"&gt;#20369&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add null reference check for animation keyframes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3787530033" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20422" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20422/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20422"&gt;#20422&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix accessibility with screen reader on &lt;code&gt;TextBlock&lt;/code&gt; with inlines by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/codecat/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/codecat"&gt;@codecat&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3793568698" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20438" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20438/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20438"&gt;#20438&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;BindingExpression.LeafNode&lt;/code&gt; throwing when nodes list is empty by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/grokys/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/grokys"&gt;@grokys&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3796269516" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20442" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20442/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20442"&gt;#20442&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation – Update &lt;code&gt;HelpLink&lt;/code&gt; for XAML namespace resolution by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3766442350" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20371" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20371/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20371"&gt;#20371&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iOS – Fix &lt;code&gt;TextInputResponder&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kerams/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kerams"&gt;@kerams&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3253320039" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19310" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19310/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19310"&gt;#19310&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Call default back callbacks when not handled by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3803884661" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20452" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20452/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20452"&gt;#20452&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Remove obsolete clipboard format &lt;code&gt;CF_TEXT&lt;/code&gt;. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/yu-kopylov/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/yu-kopylov"&gt;@yu-kopylov&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3776036739" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20389" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20389/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20389"&gt;#20389&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless – Fix &lt;code&gt;InvalidOperationException&lt;/code&gt; Dispatcher job loop detected by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wieslawsoltes/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wieslawsoltes"&gt;@wieslawsoltes&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3746796210" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20310" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20310/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20310"&gt;#20310&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/11.3.10...11.3.11"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;11.3.10...11.3.11&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
